        "$U=(\\frac{1}{4})[(\\frac{1}{4})^2+(\\frac{2}{4})^2+(\\frac{3}{4})^2+1^2]=\\frac{1+4+9+16}{64}=\\frac{30}{64}=\\frac{15}{32}$。",
        "$L=(\\frac{1}{4})[0^2+(\\frac{1}{4})^2+(\\frac{2}{4})^2+(\\frac{3}{4})^2]=\\frac{0+1+4+9}{64}=\\frac{14}{64}=\\frac{7}{32}$。",
        "差 $U-L=\\frac{8}{32}=\\frac{1}{4}$，真正的積分 $\\frac{1}{3}$ 夾在 $\\frac{7}{32}\\approx0.219$ 與 $\\frac{15}{32}\\approx0.469$ 之間。"
      ],
      "answer": "$U=\\frac{15}{32}$，$L=\\frac{7}{32}$",
      "claim": "(1+4+9+16)/64 == 15/32 ;; (0+1+4+9)/64 == 7/32 ;; 7/32 < INT(x^2,0,1) ;; INT(x^2,0,1) < 15/32"
    },
    {
