        "$L=(\\frac{1}{5})(\\frac{5}{6}+\\frac{5}{7}+\\frac{5}{8}+\\frac{5}{9}+\\frac{5}{10})=\\frac{1}{6}+\\frac{1}{7}+\\frac{1}{8}+\\frac{1}{9}+\\frac{1}{10}\\approx0.6456$。",
        "$U=(\\frac{1}{5})(1+\\frac{5}{6}+\\frac{5}{7}+\\frac{5}{8}+\\frac{5}{9})=\\frac{1}{5}+\\frac{1}{6}+\\frac{1}{7}+\\frac{1}{8}+\\frac{1}{9}\\approx0.7456$。",
