      "claim": "1/6+1/7+1/8+1/9+1/10 < log(2) ;; log(2) < 1/5+1/6+1/7+1/8+1/9 ;; (1/5+1/6+1/7+1/8+1/9)-(1/6+1/7+1/8+1/9+1/10) == 1/10"
